 "message": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1f2933; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 16px; border-radius: 6px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #102a43;\">Visitor Pass Rejected</h3>\n<p>The following visitor pass request has been rejected.</p>\n\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 12px 0;\">\n<tr style=\"background: #f4f5f7;\"><td style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\"><b style=\"color: #1f2933;\">Pass ID</b></td><td style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">{{ doc.name }}</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\"><b style=\"color: #1f2933;\">Visitor</b></td><td style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">{{ doc.visitor_full_name }}</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background: #f4f5f7;\"><td style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\"><b style=\"color: #1f2933;\">Visit Date</b></td><td style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">{{ doc.visit_date }}</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\"><b style=\"color: #1f2933;\">Purpose</b></td><td style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">{{ doc.purpose_of_visit }}</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background: #f4f5f7;\"><td style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\"><b style=\"color: #1f2933;\">Status</b></td><td style=\"padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\"><b style=\"color: #dc3545;\">Rejected</b></td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<p>If your visit still needs to happen, please <b style=\"color: #1f2933;\">contact your host directly</b> (or your HR / Administration team) for the reason and next steps. You can submit a new pre-registration once you have the details.</p>\n</div>",
